      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "when scanning - moving from current\nto next unit and putting next unit into\nprevious and then making next unit current\n\nadding content does not change current unit\n\nworker can return back to the previous unit\nand this way scan units on same level (same pallet for example) ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "when scanning - moving from current\nto next unit and putting next unit into\nprevious and then making next unit current\n\nadding content does not change current unit\n\nworker can return back to the previous unit\nand this way scan units on same level (same pallet for example) ",
