      "seed": 1418946739,
      "version": 961,
      "versionNonce": 1354378140,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785712076696,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. login and reg page, profile \n2. ASN forming page\n3. ASN search and filter page + card for each ASN with details  \n4. Goods receipt page with \n        1,2)open and close options\n        3) option to start a pallete \n5. Starting a pallete -> scanning page with options: \n        1) scan unit \n        2) scan contents (or entering manually sku and lpn) \n        3) complete session\n6. home page\n\nhttps://medium.com/@vish.shah13/ui-ux-designing-a-receiving-operation-at-the-warehouse-b1c3aa0c751b\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. login and reg page, profile \n2. ASN forming page\n3. ASN search and filter page + card for each ASN with details  \n4. Goods receipt page with \n        1,2)open and close options\n        3) option to start a pallete \n5. Starting a pallete -> scanning page with options: \n        1) scan unit \n        2) scan contents (or entering manually sku and lpn) \n        3) complete session\n6. home page\n\nhttps://medium.com/@vish.shah13/ui-ux-designing-a-receiving-operation-at-the-warehouse-b1c3aa0c751b\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
